  "review_scope": [
    "P08 requirements in master sections 9-12, 19, 64-65, 84, 136 and 139.4; phase exit gates and cumulative evidence contract.",
    "Protected process/thread construction, VM and architectural retirement, wait leases, stop/revocation races, kernel-owned peer identity and authority, queued grants and session references.",
    "Native heap and TLS runtime, service-client RPC lifetimes, service registry/readiness/restart, one-owner shared storage integration, native SDK workloads, console record trust and actual display.",
