    "Fifteen deliberately negative guest reports match the exact declared and observed outcome. The sole deliberate hang requires its recorded watchdog timeout and successful tree cleanup. All required commands and all other QEMU invocations have the expected exit code without timeout, output overflow, spawn or cleanup error. Nonrequired linker help exit1100 is recorded discovery behavior.",
